<para>When a VPE doorbell is requested for the VPE, the doorbell event is generated when the VPE doorbell conditions are met.</para>
<para>See <xref linkend="#sec:irs:virtual_interrupts:vpe_doorbells">'VPE doorbells'</xref> in Arm® Generic Interrupt Controller Architecture Specification, GIC architecture version 5 (ARM IHI 111701) for more information.</para></field_description>
    <field_values impdef="False">
      <field_value_instance>
        <field_value>0b0</field_value>
        <field_value_description>
